@finland_parliament
title: Finnish Parliament (1917)
is-card: true
view-if: year = 1917
card-image: img/reichstag_2.jpg
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// These figures read the original game state rather than a fixed text list.
// Temporary ID mapping for the 1917 starting distribution only:
// spd = SDP; z = Agrarian League; ddp = Young Finnish Party;
// dvp = People's Party; dnvp = Finnish Party; other = RKP.
Q.finland_sdp_seats = Math.round(Q.spd_r * 2);
Q.finland_agrarian_seats = Math.round(Q.z_r * 2);
Q.finland_young_finnish_seats = Math.round(Q.ddp_r * 2);
Q.finland_peoples_seats = Math.round(Q.dvp_r * 2);
Q.finland_finnish_seats = Math.round(Q.dnvp_r * 2);
Q.finland_spp_seats = Math.round(Q.other_r * 2);
!}

= Finnish Parliament - October 1917 election

The Parliament of Finland has 200 seats. A majority requires 101 seats.

Social Democratic Party (SDP) — [+ finland_sdp_seats +] seats.

Agrarian League (Maalaisliitto) — [+ finland_agrarian_seats +] seats.

Young Finnish Party (Nuorsuomalainen puolue) — [+ finland_young_finnish_seats +] seats.

People's Party (Kansanpuolue) — [+ finland_peoples_seats +] seats.

Finnish Party (Suomalainen puolue) — [+ finland_finnish_seats +] seats.

Swedish People's Party (RKP) — [+ finland_spp_seats +] seats.

These are the October 1917 starting seats, read from the original game's parliamentary state. Its future election model, German government, and event cards have not yet been adapted to Finland.

- @main: Return to main screen

